OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAfternoon
OL,6,Fcloud sinking southward leaving some
OL,7,Fevening sunshine for northern and
OL,8,Fwestern areas. Dry with clear spells
OL,9,Flikely overnight as cloud moves
OL,10,Ffurther south. Feeling fresher than of
OL,11,Flate.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA dry and bright start to
OL,14,FFriday with plenty of sunny spells.
OL,15,FCloud increasing through the day,
OL,16,Fthough staying dry with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
